Package: daggr
Title: Quick DAG Diagrams with Sensible Defaults
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person("Benjamin", "Guinaudeau", , "benjamin.guinaudeau@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Wraps 'ggdiagram' and 'ggarrow' with opinionated defaults for
    drawing directed acyclic graphs (DAGs). Provides styled node
    constructors, a connection helper, and a clean theme so that
    'library(daggr)' replaces ~30 lines of boilerplate setup.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Imports:
    ggarrow,
    ggdiagram (>= 0.1.1),
    ggplot2 (>= 4.0.0),
    rlang
Suggests:
    knitr,
    rmarkdown,
    testthat (>= 3.0.0)
VignetteBuilder: knitr
URL: https://benjaminguinaudeau.github.io/daggr/,
    https://github.com/benjaminguinaudeau/daggr
BugReports: https://github.com/benjaminguinaudeau/daggr/issues
Config/testthat/edition: 3
